[size=5][b]Vertical Split Screen[/b][/size]

Local 2-player co-op and versus split the screen [b]top/bottom[/b], which leaves each player a thin strip on wide and ultrawide monitors. This mod splits it [b]side by side[/b] instead: Player 1 on the left, Player 2 on the right.

[size=4][b]Features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Side-by-side split[/b] for local co-op and versus.
[*][b]HUD follows the split[/b]: each player's health, musou, officer gauge, morale, minimap and K.O. counter are moved into that player's half.
[*][b]F8 switches[/b] between side-by-side and the original top/bottom split at any time, even mid-battle. The HUD follows.
[*][b]Per-player wider view[/b] (side-by-side mode only): each player can widen their FOV by 0-50% with their own hotkeys. It works on top of the game's camera, so musou zooms keep working. Cutscenes are untouched.
[*]Split mode and FOV values are remembered between sessions.
[*]No game files are modified.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Controls[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]F8[/b] - switch split: side by side / top-bottom
[*][b][ / ][/b] - Player 1 view -5% / +5%
[*][b]; / '[/b] - Player 2 view -5% / +5%
[/list]
In top/bottom mode both players always use the game's default FOV.
Settings are saved to [i]ue4ss\Mods\VerticalSplit\settings.txt[/i]. Keys, step and range can be changed at the top of [i]Scripts\main.lua[/i].

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/dynastywarriors3completeeditionremastered/mods/7]UE4SS for Dynasty Warriors 3 Complete Edition Remastered[/url]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install UE4SS first ([i]dwmapi.dll[/i] and the [i]ue4ss[/i] folder next to [i]DW3CE_RE\Binaries\Win64\DW3CE_RE-Win64-Shipping.exe[/i]).
[*]Extract this archive into [i]DW3CE_RE\Binaries\Win64[/i]. You should end up with [i]ue4ss\Mods\VerticalSplit\Scripts\main.lua[/i] and [i]ue4ss\Mods\VerticalSplit\enabled.txt[/i].
[*]Start a 2-player battle.
[/list]
[b]Uninstall:[/b] delete the [i]ue4ss\Mods\VerticalSplit[/i] folder.

[size=4][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]
Tested on Steam build 25630985 with UE4SS v3.0.1-1152 (experimental). Should work with other UE4SS Lua mods. If a game update breaks it, please report your game build and attach [i]ue4ss\UE4SS.log[/i].

[size=4][b]Source[/b][/size]
Source code and issue tracker: [url=https://github.com/Vivoxti/dw3-vertical-splitscreen]github.com/Vivoxti/dw3-vertical-splitscreen[/url] (MIT license).

